      translation: "And We had already tried before them the people of Pharaoh, and there came to them a noble messenger [i.e., Musa], [Saying], \"Render to me the servants of Allah. Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger,\" And [saying], \"Be not haughty with Allah. Indeed, I have come to you with clear evidence. And indeed, I have sought refuge in my Lord and your Lord, lest you stone me. But if you do not believe me, then leave me alone.\" And [finally] he called to his Lord that these were a criminal people.",
