      translation: "And Pharaoh said, \"O Haman, construct for me a tower that I might reach the ways - The ways into the heavens - so that I may look at the deity of Musa; but indeed, I think he is a liar.\" And thus was made attractive to Pharaoh the evil of his deed, and he was averted from the [right] way. And the plan of Pharaoh was not except in ruin.",
