    content: "Al-Ma'idah says Allah took the covenant and delegated twelve leaders from among them, and told them: I am with you. Prayer, zakah, belief in My messengers and support for them, a goodly loan to Allah - and He would remove their sins and admit them to gardens. For breaking it, He says, He cursed them and hardened their hearts. And still: pardon them and overlook, for Allah loves the doers of good.",
