    order: 290,
    content: "Al-A'raf tells the entry they were offered - dwell in this city, eat from it, say the word of repentance, enter the gate bowing - and how those who wronged changed the word, and what came down on them for it. Al-Baqarah told it above, among the manna and the springs.",
    contentFr: "Al-A'raf raconte l'entrée qui leur fut offerte - habitez cette cité, mangez-en, dites le mot de repentir, entrez par la porte en vous prosternant - et comment ceux qui furent injustes changèrent le mot, et ce qui descendit sur eux pour cela. Al-Baqarah l'a raconté plus haut, entre la manne et les sources.",
